# What travels in the arrayprobe-soda2-enhancements source distribution.
#
# WHY THIS FILE EXISTS (2026-09-21) -- the same finding as
# `../enhancements_uiops/MANIFEST.in`, whose header carries the reasoning in full.
# This package likewise owns no fixtures and reaches the port's tracked data by
# `Path(__file__).resolve().parents[2] / "<port-dir>" / "tests" / "data"`,
# which in an unpacked `arrayprobe_soda2_enhancements-0.1.0.dev0/` is above the
# tarball root.
#
# MEASURED on 2026-09-21, from the unpacked sdist against a clean install:
# **113 tests, 0 skipped, 33 errors** -- 32 `FileNotFoundError`, one
# `ModuleNotFoundError` and one `ImportError` from
# `sys.path.insert(0, parents[2] / "<port-dir>" / "gdl_oracle")`. This half of
# the family fails LOUDLY rather than skipping silently, which is better, but a
# tarball whose suite reports 33 errors on a correct install "trains the reader
# to ignore red" (the port's own MANIFEST.in header) -- so the same split
# applies: a test that reaches outside its distribution root stays in the
# repository.
#
# THE LIST BELOW IS DERIVED, NOT TYPED, and
# `tests/test_sdist_has_no_silent_repo_skips.py` -- which SHIPS -- recomputes it
# and fails on drift.

graft src
graft tests
graft docs
graft tools

include LICENSE
include README.md
include BACKLOG_STATUS.md

# The attribution masters, copied from the repository root 2026-09-21; see
# ../enhancements_uiops/MANIFEST.in for why they could not travel before.
include NOTICE.md
include CITATION.cff

global-exclude *.py[cod]
global-exclude *.launch.log
prune **/__pycache__
prune .venv
prune .mypy_cache
prune .ruff_cache

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The 11 test modules that reach a path above their own distribution root.
exclude tests/test_adapter.py
exclude tests/test_aspr_nan_fix.py
exclude tests/test_den_clamp_fix.py
exclude tests/test_double_pi_fix.py
exclude tests/test_empty_roi_diodegaps_fix.py
exclude tests/test_hk_probeid_columns.py
exclude tests/test_no_stuck_diode_fix.py
exclude tests/test_rejection_tally_fix.py
exclude tests/test_rollover_modulus_fix.py
exclude tests/test_run_diagnostics.py
exclude tests/test_same_time_buffer_fix.py
